~ the runner gives every program a fresh working directory
"data/archive/2026" -> file/make-directory -> io/print-line
"data/archive" -> file/make-directory -> file/list -> io/print-line
"data/notes.txt" -> file/write "kept"
"data" -> file/make-directory -> file/list -> io/print-line
attempt | "data/notes.txt" -> file/make-directory recover e | e -> io/print-line
